# Cloudflare Pages redirect/rewrite rules. Evaluated top to bottom; static
# files that exist on disk are always served over these rules, so this only
# affects paths with no matching file.
#
# Prerendered post pages live at dist/posts/<slug>/index.html (generated by
# scripts/prerender-posts.mjs) — these explicit rewrites make sure a
# request for the clean URL (no trailing slash) resolves to that file
# rather than falling through to the SPA shell below.
/posts/:slug   /posts/:slug/index.html   200
/posts         /posts/index.html         200

# Client-side routing fallback for the rest of the app (homepage, gallery).
/*             /index.html               200
